## labwc environment — IRN OS
## Trimmed from the box's stock labwc example (only the knobs that matter).
## labwc will not override a variable already set in the environment.

## Keyboard layout (see /usr/share/X11/xkb/rules/evdev.lst for codes).
# XKB_DEFAULT_LAYOUT=us
# XKB_DEFAULT_OPTIONS=grp:alt_shift_toggle

## Cursor theme/size.
# XCURSOR_THEME=Adwaita
# XCURSOR_SIZE=24

## GTK4 compose without an input method (labwc integration note).
# GTK_IM_MODULE=simple

## If cursors vanish on some GPUs, disable hardware cursors.
# WLR_NO_HARDWARE_CURSORS=1

## --- Sanctuary optional: Twilio SMS appointment reminders --------------------
## PRIVACY NOTE: enabling these makes the Sanctuary backend send SMS via
## Twilio — that is data leaving the device. Leave unset on a strictly
## local-first appliance. The backend reads them at runtime; they are never
## exposed to the frontend or written to the vault. Log out/in to apply.
# TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
# TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
# TWILIO_FROM_NUMBER=
